  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Apple nearly tripled over five years, while Disney and Nike finished lower. The US basket gained, but less than Apple. A struggling company recovered in this window, yet that does not make every troubled business a bargain. Apple’s path included a very large monthly fall before the end.",
