  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Tiger Woods’s victory, executive pay and new technology were prominent stories. Apple’s leadership faced criticism while shareholders struggled.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Each company followed its own path. The broad basket spread company-specific risk, even though it did not match the biggest gain.",
    "what_faded_away": "An eye-catching executive pay figure did not forecast five-year returns. A sporting victory did not settle the investment outcome of a sponsor.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "The later rankings were unknown. Recognizing Apple’s name today can make its difficult position at the start look less risky than it felt.",
